			description: [
				"With the inclusion of ULV covers, you hopefully will have already been introduced to the prior version of most of these items. "
				"While serving the same functionality as their ULV counterparts, the rest that you will be making will also be used as crafting components for various machines. These, plus circuits and machine hulls, serve as the foundation for machines going forward. Due to this, you may wish to craft these components in batches so that you can save time crafting later, but due to the presence of EMI autocrafting, this is more of a choice than in older GregTech versions"
				""
				"Make one of any of them to complete this quest. You will eventually need many of all of them."
			]
