		{
			dependencies: ["02F6E1C558B0CAA4"]
			description: ["The Electrolyzer can separate compounds of basically any type, this will be the most convenient way to extract specific materials out of ores, though most useful recipes require MV. Still, you'll get some use out of it during this tier."]
