		{
			dependencies: ["54F4762CD15E8AC0"]
			description: [
				"The Canner is your gateway into creating Batteries, which can be used to store energy for use in some different ways."
				"For the first few tiers of batteries, you can create the internals out of Sodium, Cadmium, and Lithium, in order of energy capacity. Intelligent use of EMI can inform you on how to obtain them, all three can be obtained in LV through ore processing in some way. They are generally interchangeable, the only context where a specific one is required is for Night Vision Goggles, which require a Sodium battery."
				""
				"You can charge batteries or any other energy containers with the charger slot located in any appropriately tiered machine, or with a turbo charger."
				""
				"Batteries are created out of Battery Alloy, which is an alloy of Antimony and Lead. Antimony can be obtained from Stibnite Ore, found in the nether."
			]
			id: "3EDF27DDA2C82676"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3016C77ACA26F568"
					item: "gtceu:lv_canner"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "6EB3FC108F51A308"
