		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3EDF27DDA2C82676"]
			description: ["Your first Prospector, this gives you a view of all of the ore present within a 3 chunk diameter around where you used it. Incredibly useful for finding new ore veins and figuring out how to find the small or oddly shaped ones. This also adds any new ore veins to your minimap, same as if you clicked on the dust piles on the surface. Future prospectors can also show you Fluid veins and Bedrock veins."]
			id: "799552B442B9837F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "78E2E9E75DE0445B"
				item: "gtceu:prospector.lv"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"3EDF27DDA2C82676"
				"54F4762CD15E8AC0"
			]
			description: [
				"There are some utility machines related to batteries you can make."
				"The Turbo Charger will quickly charge any power tools or batteries you add to the slot. It can take 16 amps of input, providing 4 amps to each slot, effectively charging them 4x as fast than if you used the charging slot of a machine."
				"Battery buffers can not only serve as battery storage, but hold it for later use in energy transport. Each one can handle an amperage input double that of the number of slots. They can also, critically in some setups, serve as a \"refresh point\" for cable loss, as they will output the full content of the buffer at max output. Of course, you still need to provide enough energy to maintain this."
			]
			id: "476C505C515ECDB0"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "56F80CC14921252F"
					item: "gtceu:lv_charger_4x"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
