		{
			dependencies: ["3EDF27DDA2C82676"]
			description: ["Spray Cans are also unlocked with the Canner. Putting liquid forms of Dyes into Spray Cans allows you to color nearly any GregTech block. This sees use most commonly in color coding different types of cable to differentiate voltage tiers, though it can also color pipes or even machines. "]
			id: "1D1DFF0C9D12AC48"
