		{
			dependencies: ["12B2289AE89B789E"]
			description: [
				"As per last time, be sure to have ample infrastructure before continuing. Your LV machines will serve as a springboard for progression for a while, so having a crafting setup will be very important."
				""
				"Moving forward, your two primary goals are to craft Good Electronic Circuits to eventually an LV Circuit Assembler, and build an Electric Blast Furnace to create Aluminum, both are key requirements for entering MV."
			]
			id: "4798AEB718C0948B"
