		{
			dependencies: ["3EDF27DDA2C82676"]
			description: ["By default, the Night Vision Goggles are gated behind MV, as glass lenses require an MV lathe to create. This pack adds a crafting grid recipe, shamelessly stolen from GTNH, that allows you to make these as soon as you can make batteries. "]
