		{
			dependencies: [
				"7377388B1922E23B"
				"5602DBCEBB5B5509"
			]
			description: [
				"The Circuit Assembler can be seen as the last \"convenient machine\" as i've named them here, it provides more convenient recipes for both Electronic circuits you've made up to this point, and it is required for the vast majority of the remaining circuits in the mod."
				"All versions of them require the next tier of circuits to craft. This LV one needed MV circuits, the MV one will need HV circuits, etc."
			]
			id: "6F7EB02E9526F6AC"
			size: 2.0d
			tasks: [{
				id: "478604C4E81E0FCB"
