			x: 0.5d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"68993A775ACA091B"
				"04DE51E233CBE644"
			]
			description: ["Your first MV circuits. Do note that the recipe for this is exorbitantly expensive, requiring 3 Electronic Circuits. Your next objective should be to make a second one of these, then use them to make a Circuit Assembler to unlock the better recipe, and never look at the crafting grid recipe ever again."]
			id: "5602DBCEBB5B5509"
			subtitle: "Evil Electronic Circuit"
