		{
			dependencies: ["4798AEB718C0948B"]
			description: ["Cupronickel blocks are the main way to upgrade the visuals and functionality of Electric Blast Furnaces, among other multiblocks. Each one has a specified heat capacity, which, along with the voltage tier of the multiblock itself, dictate which recipes it can run. There are some nuances regarding higher tier coil blocks and the voltage tier of the multiblock that can cause this number to fluctuate upward, and it can also contribute to some overclocking bonuses, but this is never required for progression and can only serve as a nice bonus for some upgrade milestones. You will be safe by just keeping the coils and voltage tiers up to date. When in doubt, the multiblock controller GUI will tell you the heat capacity its operating at when it forms."]
			id: "7DE133345094BC67"
			tasks: [{
				count: 16L
				id: "5A220F3D4AD88E1C"
				item: "gtceu:cupronickel_coil_block"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 3.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4798AEB718C0948B"]
			id: "54A622E17FA8FD33"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6905B3B1C2FA92D5"
				item: "gtceu:lv_input_bus"
